                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x000a0;</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hydrogen bond, electrostatic (dipole-dipole)</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Backbone C=O, N-H; polar side chains (Ser, Thr, Asn, Gln)</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1-5</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Fine-tunes structure and provides specificity; crucial for secondary structure (&#x003b1;-helices, &#x003b2;-sheets) and molecular recognition.</td>
              </tr>
