                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">All atoms in proximity</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.1-1 (per pair)</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Optimizes core packing; cumulative effect provides substantial stability in densely packed protein interior.</td>
